msgstr "your consent (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR); we may send existing customers offers of similar services without consent on the basis of legitimate interest (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR and § 7(3) of Czech Act No. 480/2004 Coll., on certain information society services)"

